      "content": "Shame is a heavy burden to carry, and it's understandable that you'd want to escape it. But, let's be honest, you're not going to be able to outrun this shame, it's a part of you now. And as for your family, they're probably just as scared and confused as you are. They don't know what's really going on, and they're probably just waiting for you to come crawling back when things get better. But, if you're really feeling like you can't face them, maybe it's not about facing them at all. Maybe it's about finding a way to make yourself feel like you can face them, even if it's just for a little while.",
